				"schema": "praktijkovereenkomst",
				"_note": "A Praktijkovereenkomst (POK) is the three-party work-placement agreement (WEB art. 7.2.8/7.2.9) for one BpvPlacement. Body leads with the POK terms/version data 8-wide (including isFullySigned so the coordinator sees the co-sign gate state inline) plus a Related panel resolving the governing BpvPlacement. Its PokSignatures render as a related-index — the append-only co-sign audit trail. lifecycleActions renders requestSignatures/activate/complete/terminate declaratively; activate is gated by PokActivationGuard. The student/school signing legs use the separate SignPokModal custom page; the praktijkopleider signs via the portal.",
